---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "中国旅行保险：应该关注什么";
const description = "Why you need travel insurance for China, what it should cover, and recommended providers verified for China coverage.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/medical/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Medical
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🏥 医疗保健</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Travel Insurance for China<br class="hidden md:block" />: What to Look For
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">在旅行前购买旅行保险。这不是可选的。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读4分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-red-50 to-orange-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-red-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>是的，你需要中国旅行保险。</strong> Even though medical costs are lower than in the West, a serious incident can still cost tens of thousands of RMB. Get a policy with at least $100,000 USD medical coverage, emergency evacuation, and 24/7 English-speaking assistance.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Even though China's medical costs are much lower than in the US, a serious incident — car accident, heart attack, emergency surgery — can still cost tens of thousands of RMB. Insurance turns that from a life-ruining expense into a manageable process.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">✅</span> What Your Insurance Should Cover for China
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">覆盖</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">为什么你需要它</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">医疗费用</td><td class="px-6 py-4">至少100000美元的保险范围</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">紧急疏散</td><td class="px-6 py-4">如果你需要飞往另一个国家接受治疗</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">遣返</td><td class="px-6 py-4">如果最坏的情况发生，你的身体需要被送回家</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">行程取消</td><td class="px-6 py-4">如果你因病需要取消</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">行李遗失</td><td class="px-6 py-4">标准覆盖范围</td></tr>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">24/7援助热线</td><td class="px-6 py-4">必须有讲英语的操作员</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏆</span> Recommended Insurance Providers
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-1">世界游牧民族</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-blue-600 mb-3">最适合：探险旅行者、背包客和短期游客</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li>•涵盖300多种活动，包括徒步长城、骑自行车和水上运动</li>
            <li>•两个计划：标准（预算）和探索者（以更高限额为重点的冒险）</li>
            <li>•紧急医疗、疏散、行程取消和行李保险</li>
            <li>•提供多语言支持的24/7紧急援助</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-1">安全翼</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-green-600 mb-3">最适合：数字游牧民、远程工作者和长期旅行者</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li>•基于订阅——按月支付，随时取消，无长期承诺</li>
            <li>•游牧保险起价约为每月45美元，涵盖医疗、疏散和旅行中断</li>
            <li>•全球覆盖，包括中国，延长住宿可自动续期</li>
            <li>•还提供Nomad Health（真正的门诊健康保险）</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-1">AXA旅行保险（AXA援助）</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-purple-600 mb-3">最适合：全面覆盖（主要针对美国/欧洲居民）</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li>•四个计划级别，从OnTrip（基本）到精英（最大覆盖范围）</li>
            <li>•Explorer Select和Elite计划涵盖预先存在的疾病</li>
            <li>•全天候帮助热线，配有英语操作员</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-yellow-900"><strong>注：</strong> Brand names above are plain text for now. Affiliate links will be added once the affiliate program is set up, turning each brand name into a clickable link.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    
    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">VPN服务经常发生变化。没有单一的官方消息来源。在旅行前研究当前的建议。</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li>保险比较因旅行者的祖国而异。没有单一的官方消息来源。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/medical/seeing-a-doctor/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">在中国看医生</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">诊所、医院和预期</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/medical/top-hospitals/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">拥有国际科室的顶级医院</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">中国最好的外国人医院</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/tips/emergency-numbers/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">紧急电话号码和该怎么办</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">在需要之前先保存这些</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>